    {
      "source": "Determine whether the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> identified by the supplied <code>className</code> is present and can be loaded and\ncall the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>action</code></a> if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> could be loaded.",
      "translation": "确定由提供的 <code>className</code> 标识的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> 是否存在且可以加载，并在该 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> 能够被加载时调用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>action</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Loads the class with the given name using the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>加载给定名称的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Essentially translates <code>NoSuchMethodException</code> to <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "本质上将 <code>NoSuchMethodException</code> 转换为 <code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
