    {
      "source": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"Class ClassUtils\">Class ClassUtils</h1>",
      "translation": "<h1 class=\"title\" title=\"类 ClassUtils\">类 ClassUtils</h1>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether the given class has a public constructor with the given signature, and return it if available\n(else return <code>null</code>).",
      "translation": "确定给定类是否具有具有给定签名的公共构造函数，如果存在则返回该构造函数（否则返回<code>null</code>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Core",
      "translation": "Spring Data 核心",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Utility class to work with classes.",
      "translation": "用于操作类的工具类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Modifier and Type",
      "translation": "修改类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>clazz</code> - the clazz to analyze</dd>\n<dd><code>paramTypes</code> - the parameter types of the method</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the constructor, or <code>null</code> if not found</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>4.0</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getDeclaredConstructor(java.lang.Class...)\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.getDeclaredConstructor(Class...)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>clazz</code> - 要分析的类</dd>\n<dd><code>paramTypes</code> - 方法的参数类型</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>构造函数，如果未找到则返回 <code>null</code></dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>4.0</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getDeclaredConstructor(java.lang.Class...)\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Class.getDeclaredConstructor(Class...)</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">Description</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#ifPresent(java.lang.String,java.lang.ClassLoader,java.util.function.Consumer)\" tabindex=\"0\">ifPresent(String, ClassLoader, Consumer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#loadIfPresent(java.lang.String,java.lang.ClassLoader)\" tabindex=\"0\">loadIfPresent(String, ClassLoader)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#getDeclaredConstructorIfAvailable(java.lang.Class,java.lang.Class...)\" tabindex=\"0\">getDeclaredConstructorIfAvailable(Class, Class...)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
      "translation": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">描述</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">方法摘要</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">方法详情</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#ifPresent(java.lang.String,java.lang.ClassLoader,java.util.function.Consumer)\" tabindex=\"0\">ifPresent(String, ClassLoader, Consumer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#loadIfPresent(java.lang.String,java.lang.ClassLoader)\" tabindex=\"0\">loadIfPresent(String, ClassLoader)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#getDeclaredConstructorIfAvailable(java.lang.Class,java.lang.Class...)\" tabindex=\"0\">getDeclaredConstructorIfAvailable(Class, Class...)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>className</code> - the name of the class to check.</dd>\n<dd><code>classLoader</code> - the class loader to use (can be null, which indicates the default class loader).</dd>\n<dd><code>action</code> - the action callback to notify.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if the corresponding class is resolvable but there was a readability mismatch in the\n          inheritance hierarchy of the class (typically a missing dependency declaration in a Jigsaw module\n          definition for a superclass or interface implemented by the class to be checked here)</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>className</code> - 要检查的类的名称。</dd>\n<dd><code>classLoader</code> - 要使用的类加载器（可以为 null，表示使用默认类加载器）。</dd>\n<dd><code>action</code> - 要通知的操作回调。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果对应的类是可解析的，但在该类的继承层次结构中出现了可读性不匹配（通常是因为在 Jigsaw 模块定义中缺少对要检查的类所实现的超类或接口的依赖声明）。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>name</code> - the name of the class to be loaded.</dd>\n<dd><code>classLoader</code> - the class loader to use (can be null, which indicates the default class loader).</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> or null in case the class can't be loaded for any reason.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>name</code> - 要加载的类的名称。</dd>\n<dd><code>classLoader</code> - 要使用的类加载器（可以为 null，表示使用默认类加载器）。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Class</code></a> 对象，或者在因任何原因无法加载该类时返回 null。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>3.5</dd>\n<dt>Author:</dt>\n<dd>Oliver Gierke, Mark Paluch, Johannes Englmeier</dd>",
